cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "irrationality-sequences-lean4: A Lean 4 proof that irrationality sequences exist"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 proof that some sequence of positive integers keeps an irrational
  reciprocal sum under every bounded integer perturbation with nonzero
  denominators (the existence question of Erdős Problem 264). The theorems use
  only the axioms propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound.
